    采 | cǎi | pluck; pick; gather
    彩 | cǎi | colorful; vibrant; prize

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 蔬菜 is the standard collective botanical noun for cultivated edible garden greens, roots, and pods.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 蔬菜 vs. 菜 | cài | 蔬菜 strictly denotes raw botanical vegetables (greens, carrots, cabbages), whereas 菜 is polysemous, widely meaning cooked culinary dishes, cuisine styles, or whole courses (川菜, 点菜).
    2 | 蔬菜 vs. 水果 | shuǐguǒ | 蔬菜 are savory crops cooked for savory meals, whereas 水果 are sweet or tart fleshy fruits eaten raw as desserts or snacks.
    3 | 蔬菜 vs. 野菜 | yěcài | 蔬菜 are domesticated crops grown on farms and gardens, while 野菜 are wild foraged uncultivated edible herbs picked in mountains.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 清晨的农贸市场上热闹非凡，菜农们的竹筐里码放着刚从菜园采摘的时令蔬菜。水灵灵的青菜叶片上还挂着晶莹的露珠，泥土的清香在空气中弥漫开来。这些鲜嫩翠绿的蔬菜，散发着大自然最淳朴温润的勃勃生机。 | Qīngchén de nóngmào shìchǎng shàng rènào-fēifán, càinóng men de zhúkuāng lǐ mǎfàng zhe gāng cóng càiyuán cǎizhāi de shílìng shūcài. Shuǐlínglíng de qīngcàiyè piàn shàng hái guà zhe jīngyíng de lùzhū, nítǔ de qīngxiāng zài kōngqì zhōng mímàn kāilái. Zhèxiē xiānnèn cuìlǜ de shūcài, sànfà zhe dàzìrán zuì chúnpǔ wēnrùn de bóbó shēngjī. | The morning market bustles as farmers' bamboo baskets display seasonal vegetables picked fresh from gardens. Dewdrops cling to tender greens, earth fragrances filling the air. These verdant greens radiate nature's purest vitality. | El mercado matutino bulle de vida con los canastos de mimbre rebosantes de verduras recién cortadas. Gotas de rocío brillan sobre las acelgas esparciendo aroma a tierra fértil; estas hortalizas verdes respiran la savia pura del campo.
  #2 | 在现代都市立体农业与设施园艺示范区，基于物联网环境控制与无土栽培技术的智慧蔬菜工厂正在规模化普及。全密闭车间内精准调配光照养分，全年稳定产出高品质有机蔬菜，为特大城市群菜篮子安全提供了坚实的科技保障。 | Zài xiàndài dūshì lìtǐ nóngyè yǔ shèshī yuányì shìfànqū, jīyú wùliánwǎng huánjìng kòngzhì yǔ wútǔ zāipéi jìshù de zhìhuì shūcài gōngchǎng zhèngzài guīmóhuà pǔjí. Quánmìbì chējiān nèi jīngzhǔn tiáopèi guāngzhào yǎngfèn, quánnián wěndìng chǎnchū gāopǐnzhì yǒujī shūcài, wèi tēdà chéngshìqún càilánzi ānquán tígōng le jiānshí de kējì bǎozhàng. | In vertical farms and demonstration zones, smart hydroponic vegetable factories powered by IoT climate controls are proliferating. Sealed facilities regulate nutrients, reliably supplying organic vegetables and safeguarding megacities' food baskets. | En la agricultura hidropónica urbana, las fábricas inteligentes de hortalizas automatizadas por sensores crecen con fuerza. Sus recintos climatizados nutren verduras orgánicas todo el año, blindando el abastecimiento de las grandes metrópolis.
